### 5.2. XP & Task Idempotency Accounting
* **Flaw:** [`AppContext.tsx:L735`](file:///c:/Users/pc/Downloads/levelup-study%20%285%29/src/context/AppContext.tsx#L735) runs `setXp(prev => prev + amount)`. Rapid toggling allows infinite XP farming.
* **Target Architecture:** An append-only ledger `xpTransactions: XPTransaction[]` where:
  $$\text{Total XP} = \sum_{tx \in \text{xpTransactions}} tx.\text{amount}$$
  A task completion event with `idempotencyKey: "${taskId}_${completedAt}"` can only produce one ledger record. Toggling off appends an offsetting transaction with `-amount`.

